{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out Match Shot Chimera's explosive match-3 shoot 'em up gameplay in this demo! This is a preview of the full game, which is still in development. I'd love your feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730320/extras/matchshot-minibosses-a05.gif?t=1747409635\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Match Shot Chimera is a match-3 shmup where you save the world from deadly colored blocks by\u00a0shooting\u00a0everything, matching blocks, and leveling\u00a0up. Match blocks to deal big damage and collect XP for leveling up your chimera's abilities, all while dodging a wild array of enemies and bullets!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730320?t=1747409635","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730320?t=1747409635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730320/3827c1b575aefeb5bb5419fa8577483d7d4a36fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747409635","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730320/3827c1b575aefeb5bb5419fa8577483d7d4a36fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747409635","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out Match Shot Chimera's explosive match-3 shoot 'em up gameplay in this demo! This is a preview of the full game, which is still in development. I'd love your feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730320/extras/matchshot-minibosses-a05.gif?t=1747409635